oRFe9vRwZpIQ7kNvwHAgnEp&_nc_oc=AdoKa6Vl_YAW0D61pOL3YTniN5a2Sc1BwQOVxzpCQcyekZ0KjgMqW1zA1iG41oyZyjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71LsAzRVotXnep7YTpaSVnQQ3Wlc2o8yfJNWMCWV5o6A&oe=6A09CD37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1GWSBXVzAyQQ7kNvwEj5bfe&_nc_oc=AdofPheTFEAoKJ-6pNJ5FPFb2GOZQRyIlLi7tDk3bQTQ4HUgE4dSQP_oXSOLr5lpWXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wmiZBsus-P0DXrRjtwYkb5kWu39MiATkWPS3fP1OmcA&oe=6A09CECA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I9kIWGV-02kQ7kNvwEzcmg8&_nc_oc=AdpHhy7YT04_6uI8xzie_Gsdtnu_uBIUNSugMtMvQCVSruYkdOoDP73KzPTK_Txlefs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6VDrAaP_ustR8iAzYeMyHIdobAGTyIqtzIWqhQch485A&oe=6A09BBEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QDmZutILxikQ7kNvwGQySwC&_nc_oc=Adp55OFx9oXsKOCa2iMjNKie0D8V2OiEztbXGXLIU_HRrNBdLOf1h5GRuuIHIAHWqi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4UfSm7v5Oxg4HrrvYZSqhDwD9dFT8ceGYRyR-IiJ7HcQ&oe=6A09DD83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fDyDBfSevkgQ7kNvwGzeDEC&_nc_oc=AdqrCmdT_rHlEiyBGzSW2cIY5uIA7ryXV4BmlgVKRW-uRSZ3kMlSmRVTEYbtL_m02BY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5UUavr-dja07p1-Xj8TfdmvqfLmfCfy4YDCNPm3E-kpw&oe=6A09D5D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eZlYm71ogcIQ7kNvwGcEMbd&_nc_oc=AdqhDNIFBTG_VRNXUZtbMZ9WtK6GFt4_91xoJk20dd-0VMgvAl6aquw-WGaFQLoNEpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5b3FfanZvpo7VxKmQpt9ejQS4_V-dt2hc9hiOZZIscVQ&oe=6A09B0BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080